      "value": "this would likely make the network overhead so much worse on vrchat ngl lol\n\nsome avatar creators probably wouldn't want x prop to be used with their avatar either and some world developers wouldn't want some props to be used aswell (eg. a prop that allows you to fly as some creators clearly dont want that happening in their world.) if the bad things like colliders was removed from avatars and props have a way harder limit then avatars then this could be a decent thing probably",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
