      "value": "@{5f2dad8e8950d37cd07f7616|full_name} \n\n\"This would kind of support in reducing the performance stats on avatars\" while it might reduce its ranking on a avatar it would still produce the same performance if you was to just upload the props and use them with the avatar and if anything would make avatars appear better then they actually are and the performance system ranking might need to adjust for this. (old avatars and new avatars are still likely to package their own props into the avatar regardless so it would be more of an issue + them not being packaged into the avatar means lower performance regardless.)\n\n\"Unfortunately for avatars and world creators, inevitable things can happen regardless of their wish.\" for props its a easy fix, as seen on other platforms such as Roblox you can put limitations on what types of gears/ props can and cannot be used and if it really comes down to it a world creator should be able to outright delete it upon them spawning.",
